From 5d91ac9e1ae92f118472bed8d98699e0e421d8e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 07 Aug 2018 11:19:56 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] board: habana: rework the remote/local scripts system

Move all the functionality to run locally on the dali host machine.
The control stays on the remote machine, but united into one script
with parameters.
This enables for a better code shring and different invokations of
the same scripting system.

Signed-off-by: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
---

